1
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:33,500
Big meets bigger.

2
00:08:55,000 --> 00:09:01,000
Rampage is a action, adventure, science fiction film directed by Brad Peyton.

3
00:13:22,500 --> 00:13:28,500
Primatologist Davis Okoye shares an unshakable bond with George, the extraordinarily
intelligent, silverback gorilla who has been in his care since birth.

4
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:56,000
But a rogue genetic experiment gone awry mutates this gentle
ape into a raging creature of enormous size.

5
00:22:17,500 --> 00:22:23,500
To make matters worse, it’s soon discovered there
are other similarly altered animals.

6
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:51,000
As these newly created alpha predators tear across North America, destroying everything in their path, Okoye teams with a discredited genetic engineer to secure an
antidote, fighting his way through an ever-changing battlefield, not only to halt a global catastrophe but to save the fearsome creature that was once his friend.

7
00:31:12,500 --> 00:31:18,500
Davis Okoye, played by Dwayne Johnson.

8
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:46,000
Dr. Kate Caldwell, played by Naomie Harris.

9
00:40:07,500 --> 00:40:13,500
Claire Wyden, played by Malin Åkerman.

10
00:44:35,000 --> 00:44:41,000
Harvey Russell, played by Jeffrey Dean Morgan.

11
00:49:02,500 --> 00:49:08,500
Brett Wyden, played by Jake Lacy.

12
00:53:30,000 --> 00:53:36,000
Burke, played by Joe Manganiello.

13
00:57:57,500 --> 00:58:03,500
Rampage is a 2018 American science fiction monster film loosely based on the
video game series by Midway Games, and starring Dwayne Johnson.

14
01:02:25,000 --> 01:02:31,000
The film was directed by Brad Peyton and written by
Ryan Engle, Carlton Cuse, Ryan J.

15
01:06:52,500 --> 01:06:58,500
Condal, and Adam Sztykiel.

16
01:11:20,000 --> 01:11:26,000
Naomie Harris, Malin Akerman, Jake Lacy, and Jeffrey
Dean Morgan star in supporting roles.

17
01:15:47,500 --> 01:15:53,500
In the film, a primatologist and his leucistic gorilla friend, George, team-up to stop a pair of other animals that, along with
George, have been mutated into raging beasts with fluctuating enhancements thanks to a gene-manipulating pathogen.

18
01:20:15,000 --> 01:20:21,000
The film is the third collaboration between Peyton and Johnson, following
Journey 2: The Mysterious Island (2012) and San Andreas (2015).

19
01:24:42,500 --> 01:24:48,500
Principal photography began in April 2017 in Chicago.

20
01:29:10,000 --> 01:29:16,000
The film was released in the United States on April 13, 2018, by Warner Bros.

21
01:33:37,500 --> 01:33:43,500
It received mixed reviews from critics and grossed $428
million on a $120–140 million budget.

22
01:38:05,000 --> 01:38:11,000
The film explores themes of monster, wolf, mutation, gorilla, giant monster.

23
01:42:32,500 --> 01:42:38,500
The tone is thought_provoking.
